# check that selecting a nonempty mailbox picks up all messages
depends preparebody
send 1
a unselect
receive 2
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
a OK done
send 1
c select inbox
receive 8
* 32 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 33] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
c OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
d1 noop
receive 1
d1 OK done
send 1
d2 noop
receive 1
d2 OK done
send 1
d3 noop
receive 1
d3 OK done
send 1
d4 noop
receive 1
d4 OK done
send 1
d5 noop
receive 1
d5 OK done
end
